1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:07,560
On the Service levels card, the SLA threshold is how long an item

2
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:10,680
may wait before it breaches the service level.

3
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:13,380
The Live dashboard counts the breaches.

4
00:00:13,841 --> 00:00:19,222
Age waiting items past the SLA threshold raises their priority, so old items

5
00:00:19,222 --> 00:00:21,584
are not stuck behind new ones.

6
00:00:21,584 --> 00:00:24,471
First-response target is for messages.

7
00:00:24,943 --> 00:00:29,282
Under Skills, Required skills lists skills an agent must hold.

8
00:00:29,282 --> 00:00:31,643
Add skill requirement is finer:

9
00:00:31,643 --> 00:00:38,023
a minimum proficiency, required or only preferred, and a time after which the rule is dropped.

